</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
            
          <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">   </span><span id="alg1.l2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:80%;">declare</span><span id="alg1.l2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;"> String as </span><span id="alg1.l2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:80%;">“I am a leader of a swarm, can you write some lua program to control the swarm for me?”</span><span id="alg1.l2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">
